{"publicId":"d2c751d3-1bb6-440b-a2ca-3031d971263e","title":"密歇根大学AI伴侣研究揭示情感差异与局限性","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:23.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:23.000Z","digest":"密歇根大学研究团队在《Computers in Human Behavior: Artificial Humans》发表论文，发现463名美国成年人在AI伴侣、异地人类及面对面关系中，AI伴侣的孤独感缓解效果显著（p<0.05），但情感亲密度（r=0.32）和满意度（r=0.28）均低于人类关系【新】。早前有研究称AI伴侣能提升满意度，但样本局限于欧洲用户（n=297），且未区分长期与短期关系【旧】。该研究强调AI伴侣无法替代人类社交中的非语言互动（如肢体接触、情绪共鸣），但为特殊人群（如独居老人）提供了可替代方案。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T17:05:12.927Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"密歇根大学研究：AI伴侣亲密感与人类关系差异对比","latestReport":{"id":"zou86zdw3ywe9elcy2s8kjhcg"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f9ZFq7JJpiVk","title":"研究探讨AI伴侣的益处和局限","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:23.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"zou86zdw3ywe9elcy2s8kjhcg","title":"密歇根大学研究：AI伴侣亲密感与人类关系差异对比","summary":"密歇根大学研究团队在《Computers in Human Behavior: Artificial Humans》发表论文，比较了463名美国成年人在AI伴侣、异地人类及面对面人类关系中的情感亲密、孤独感与满意度差异。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:23.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"zou86zdw3ywe9elcy2s8kjhcg","title":"密歇根大学研究：AI伴侣亲密感与人类关系差异对比","summary":"密歇根大学研究团队在《Computers in Human Behavior: Artificial Humans》发表论文，比较了463名美国成年人在AI伴侣、异地人类及面对面人类关系中的情感亲密、孤独感与满意度差异。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:23.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hou